WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:01.640
- [Kelly] So usually, I'm not into horror

00:00:01.640 --> 00:00:03.500
cause I'm scared so much of it,

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:05.290
but I like the island aspect

00:00:05.290 --> 00:00:06.390
and like what's gonna happen,

00:00:06.390 --> 00:00:07.810
for some reason that intrigues me.

00:00:07.810 --> 00:00:09.410
But I hear your husband might be like me,

00:00:09.410 --> 00:00:10.290
and he doesn't like horror.

00:00:10.290 --> 00:00:11.580
So do you think he's going to watch it?

00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:12.577
- No, he hasn't watched it.

00:00:12.577 --> 00:00:13.920
- [Kelly] Oh (laughs) he has not.

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:15.920
- I also did another Mike Flanagan show,

00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:17.210
called "The Haunting of Hill House."

00:00:17.210 --> 00:00:18.043
- [Kelly] Oh yeah.

00:00:18.043 --> 00:00:19.650
- And I took my husband to the premiere,

00:00:19.650 --> 00:00:21.850
and he's never forgiven me.
(crowd laughs)

00:00:21.850 --> 00:00:24.070
If anyone's seen "The Bent-Neck Lady."

00:00:24.070 --> 00:00:24.903
- Yeah. Yup.

00:00:24.903 --> 00:00:26.510
- Yeah, it's terrifying, right?

00:00:26.510 --> 00:00:28.230
- [Kelly] No, but I do
love the island aspect.

00:00:28.230 --> 00:00:30.870
I think it's a really cool
concept of how they're doing it.

00:00:30.870 --> 00:00:31.703
- [Annabeth] Yeah, and I think

00:00:31.703 --> 00:00:32.640
this is a little bit different

00:00:32.640 --> 00:00:35.570
because it really investigates,
sort of, religious ideas.

00:00:35.570 --> 00:00:36.403
What is-
- [Kelly] Which I love.

00:00:36.403 --> 00:00:39.070
- Yep, very, it's about faith and science.

00:00:39.070 --> 00:00:42.250
I play Dr. Sarah Gunning, who's
kind of the voice of reason

00:00:42.250 --> 00:00:45.040
on the island when all of
these mysterious things

00:00:45.040 --> 00:00:45.873
start to happen.

00:00:45.873 --> 00:00:47.010
- [Kelly] Yeah, I love
what faith has brought,

00:00:47.010 --> 00:00:48.580
I remember Stigmata way back in the day.

00:00:48.580 --> 00:00:49.413
- [Annabeth] Oh yeah, yes.
- [Kelly] You saw that?

00:00:49.413 --> 00:00:51.470
I love that. That scared
the crap out of me,

00:00:51.470 --> 00:00:53.590
but I love how they tie that in.

00:00:53.590 --> 00:00:56.120
- [Annabeth] Well, I think
religion kind of lends itself.

00:00:56.120 --> 00:00:58.820
There are certain things
about religious things

00:00:58.820 --> 00:01:01.060
that are scary, terrifying.

00:01:01.060 --> 00:01:03.390
- But have your sons watched
it? Do they like scary stuff?

00:01:03.390 --> 00:01:06.180
- Well, one of my sons loves
horror, my older son Cash,

00:01:06.180 --> 00:01:08.170
but my younger son is very
much like my husband Wade,

00:01:08.170 --> 00:01:09.930
and so no, they will not.

00:01:09.930 --> 00:01:12.470
They'll watch Squid Game,
which I think is strangely -

00:01:12.470 --> 00:01:13.460
- [Kelly] Everyone is talking about this,

00:01:13.460 --> 00:01:14.940
I've never seen it,
everyone's talking about it.

00:01:14.940 --> 00:01:18.770
- Yeah, I think it's
strangely more scarier to me

00:01:18.770 --> 00:01:20.240
than Midnight Mass is.
- [Kelly] Okay.

00:01:20.240 --> 00:01:21.420
- Because it's just like real, like -

00:01:21.420 --> 00:01:23.080
- [Kelly] That's just rude,
they're not watching your work.

00:01:23.080 --> 00:01:24.700
- [Annabeth] Well we're
number one and number two,

00:01:24.700 --> 00:01:25.856
I think, right?

00:01:25.856 --> 00:01:26.860
- [Kelly] Okay, well whatever.
- [Annabeth] But yeah, I know

00:01:26.860 --> 00:01:27.693
- It's rude.

00:01:27.693 --> 00:01:29.860
- [Annabeth] Yes, I know, I'm
their mom. C'mon, watch me.

00:01:29.860 --> 00:01:31.710
- [Kelly] Watch it, be scared for me.

